er-enumeration.json settles whether an independent enumeration yields the same items (E-B).\",\n    \"Q3\": \"The child's enumeration.json is the admissible E-B input the merge rule consumes; its availability lets the rule compute the final union, the single-source flags, and the completeness boolean (E-C).\"\n  }\n}\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1457,"cache_read_input_tokens":50866,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1457},"output_tokens":16,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f203153e-0ca2-408b-882a-8df51a69b6c8","uuid":"3c658eec-e1e6-43d8-827f-f4c2b4c12bf0","timestamp":"2026-08-09T17:11:29.908Z","request_id":"req_011CdsYetdK3f4HnALDzWR9F"}
